	(text "ECS ECX-53B, 10 pF load, at most 100 ohm.\nLoad capacitors: 2 x (10 pF - 5 pF stray) = 10 pF.\nUSB and the USB bootloader need this clock."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 105.41 0)
		(effects
